  "description": "Record\u202fID\u202f000123456 (UUID\u202f123e4567\u2011e89b\u201112d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174000) was entered into the\u202fpeople\u202fdomain under the\u202fpeople.aarhusteater\u202fschema on 2023\u201105\u201110\u202fat\u202f14:30\u202fUTC by user\u202farchive_admin. The entry was most recently updated on 2024\u201103\u201101\u202fat\u202f09:15\u202fUTC by\u202fmetadata_editor and is currently marked as\u202fvalidated. The entity is displayed as \u201cJohn\u202fHansen\u201d.\n\nJohn\u202fHansen (birth name\u202fJensen) is a Danish\u202fSkuespiller (male) born on 1975\u201104\u201122 in Aarhus, Danmark. He is best known for his work at Aarhus\u202fTeater, with notable performances in *Hamlet* and *The\u202fSeagull*. A portrait can be viewed at https://aarhusteater.dk/images/portraits/john-hansen.jpg. His original theatre identifier is\u202fATH\u20111975\u2011001; he studied at Kunstakademiet,\u202fK\u00f8benhavn and graduated in\u202f1998. The biography was compiled from https://aarhusteater.dk/person/john-hansen and the Dansk\u202fTeaterbibliotek\u202f(2022)."
